{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:23:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_697dce27368a4a3299f1a3a4c5e3fa58","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d86aed90dcb22d75feb37762f854c5875bdb35d1aa2c0371bab5e645679b7263","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"norvialabs/forge@8a1c5e85ec5c snapshot d8ce37fcadf8e938","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_251a731c0545d4617bb94ba8f9ff56b94446de8c58e7c4f55e4453e4b06b3754"],"source_ids":["src_baf994dcafae5fa59ab3a0c74139341e"],"text":"If the OS cannot confine (e.g. bubblewrap missing or unsupported platform), Forge refuses to start, printing the reason on stderr; there is no setting that turns oversight off without an enforcement floor.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:23:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_697dce27368a4a3299f1a3a4c5e3fa58"}
